{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"github--awesome-copilot--vcpkg","name":"vcpkg","description":"Guide for setting up vcpkg in C++ projects, managing dependency versions, and cross-compiling. Covers manifest initialization, CMake and Visual Studio integration, classic-to-manifest migration, version pinning, baselines, overrides, triplets, and cross-compilation. Use when a user is working with vcpkg project setup, installation, version management, or cross-platform builds. For specialized tasks, additional references cover custom registries and overlay ports (references/registries.md), CI/CD and binary caching (references/ci.md), and troubleshooting and dependency lifecycle (references/troubleshooting.md).","category":"Cloud & DevOps","tags":["vcpkg","guide","setting","up","c++","projects","managing","dependency","versions","cross","compiling.","covers","manifest","initialization","cmake","visual","studio","integration"],"repo":"github/awesome-copilot","owner":"github","stars":39345,"official":true,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"1f5644080a525d26a2e24f61a7609fb9b261c21a","path":"skills/vcpkg","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/github/awesome-copilot/tree/1f5644080a525d26a2e24f61a7609fb9b261c21a/skills/vcpkg","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T01:29:08Z","fileCount":5,"bytes":22320,"sha256":"c9568ce0fd8c7afbff4dc242af9b96290651352bdc83ed18c5db9c63cabc021c","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"skills/vcpkg/SKILL.md","bytes":10323,"sha256":"c9568ce0fd8c7afbff4dc242af9b96290651352bdc83ed18c5db9c63cabc021c","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/github/awesome-copilot/1f5644080a525d26a2e24f61a7609fb9b261c21a/skills/vcpkg/SKILL.md"},{"path":"references/ci.md","sourcePath":"skills/vcpkg/references/ci.md","bytes":4304,"sha256":"6c62369771a6e4fb39de133a8f9e10a4106d2dc55a50242bad55763ebaceb349","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/github/awesome-copilot/1f5644080a5